WEBVTT

01:49.470 --> 01:54.950
[A Dream Within A Dream]

01:55.039 --> 01:57.990
[Episode 24]

02:17.450 --> 02:23.320
♪ The mortal world entangles,
so much sorrow and chill in the mist ♪

02:26.329 --> 02:32.130
♪ Our fates intertwine and weave
into a story ♪

02:34.190 --> 02:38.070
♪ Listening to the wind whispering
by my ear ♪

02:38.960 --> 02:41.900
♪ The schemes of the dark night ♪

02:42.820 --> 02:46.910
♪ Eyes guarding a single sunrise ♪

02:45.680 --> 02:46.710
It really is you,

02:47.900 --> 02:50.810
♪ When will there be a way home? ♪

02:48.240 --> 02:49.030
Nan Heng.

02:52.280 --> 02:55.970
♪ Time brings life and death, binding life
but not the heart ♪

02:56.900 --> 03:00.440
♪ Stepping into the ranks of fate,
each pain a prelude ♪

03:01.770 --> 03:04.740
♪ Transformed in a fleeting moment,
like a dream, elusive and near ♪

03:03.690 --> 03:05.190
I can explain it. I...

03:06.210 --> 03:09.520
♪ How can love and hate be hidden? ♪

03:10.220 --> 03:13.500
♪ Time brings life and death, binding life
but not the heart ♪

03:12.310 --> 03:13.120
Fine.

03:14.190 --> 03:15.000
Explain it then.

03:14.800 --> 03:19.079
♪ Making all moves in life cautiously,
joy and sorrow already destined ♪

03:18.240 --> 03:19.000
Go ahead.

03:19.520 --> 03:20.590
I'll hear you out.

03:19.829 --> 03:23.140
♪ If one dares oppose Heaven,
how can the ending be rewritten? ♪

03:24.430 --> 03:31.640
♪ So close yet still, we part ways ♪

03:27.710 --> 03:29.590
You can barely say a word.

03:30.910 --> 03:32.770
What explanation can you give me?

03:38.240 --> 03:39.000
I'm sorry.

03:40.030 --> 03:40.840
I...

03:46.270 --> 03:47.190
Song Yimeng!

03:49.750 --> 03:51.610
You approached me with a purpose.

03:52.110 --> 03:53.079
You used me.

03:53.310 --> 03:54.870
You watched me act silly

03:54.870 --> 03:56.400
as you played me like a fool.

03:57.430 --> 03:58.710
Are you satisfied now?

04:03.280 --> 04:04.800
I really am a fool.

04:07.000 --> 04:09.080
I thought I was the reason

04:10.240 --> 04:11.680
for all your suffering.

04:14.520 --> 04:16.190
I was constantly worried

04:17.430 --> 04:19.240
that Nan Heng would hurt you.

04:20.310 --> 04:22.510
I was worried about you the entire time.

04:22.560 --> 04:23.430
But meanwhile,

04:24.830 --> 04:25.690
what did you do?

04:27.390 --> 04:29.190
You never stopped lying to me.

04:30.050 --> 04:31.690
You never stopped using me.

04:32.560 --> 04:33.360
No.

04:33.600 --> 04:34.659
Please hear me out.

04:34.720 --> 04:35.600
Stop it.

04:38.680 --> 04:40.610
Don't bother telling me anything.

04:42.270 --> 04:43.070
Nan Heng,

04:45.310 --> 04:47.830
you had so many chances
to tell me the truth,

04:49.310 --> 04:51.630
but you seized none of them.

04:53.370 --> 04:55.000
Not even one.

04:58.120 --> 04:59.510
It wasn't like that.

04:59.820 --> 05:01.190
I didn't mean to lie to you.

05:01.190 --> 05:02.040
Can you believe me?

05:02.040 --> 05:02.920
Can you just believe me once?

05:02.920 --> 05:04.240
What should I believe?

05:06.270 --> 05:07.670
That you're not Nan Heng?

05:09.920 --> 05:11.240
Or that Li Shiliu

05:12.240 --> 05:13.800
has never lied to me?

05:14.920 --> 05:20.480
♪ I leave the book aside,
though I haven't finished reading it ♪

05:22.510 --> 05:23.780
Say something.

05:23.860 --> 05:29.600
♪ I know one day I can have
a glimpse of the ending ♪

05:29.600 --> 05:30.870
Say something now!

05:32.780 --> 05:36.860
♪ Life is unpredictable ♪

05:37.740 --> 05:40.720
♪ Who can get rid of perplexity ♪

05:40.680 --> 05:41.360
Song Yimeng, I...

05:41.360 --> 05:41.800
Let go of me.

05:41.530 --> 05:46.130
♪ And find the answer he yearns for? ♪

05:41.800 --> 05:42.510
Song Yimeng,

05:42.510 --> 05:43.560
what do I have to do
to have your forgiveness?

05:43.560 --> 05:44.890
I told you to let go of me!

05:46.600 --> 05:47.730
I asked you to let go.

05:49.070 --> 05:50.070
Did you hear that?

05:50.270 --> 05:53.420
♪ Let the wind flip through
the past chapters of my life ♪

05:52.360 --> 05:53.159
Fine.

05:54.270 --> 05:55.390
You won't let go, will you?

05:54.840 --> 05:57.890
♪ Let brush and ink
depict my adventures ♪

05:59.190 --> 06:05.760
♪ Let's see how many ways
fate can shape my life in ♪

06:08.270 --> 06:11.710
♪ Let moonlight shine on
the lines about love and hate ♪

06:12.710 --> 06:16.270
♪ Let me bang my head
against a brick wall ♪

06:17.120 --> 06:17.920
Nan Heng,

06:17.270 --> 06:23.590
♪ If this is my destiny,
I'll accept it ♪

06:19.310 --> 06:20.870
I'll say this one last time.

06:22.630 --> 06:24.040
I'm done being a fool.

06:24.750 --> 06:26.070
Stop acting

06:26.800 --> 06:28.240
like you love me dearly.

06:28.750 --> 06:30.040
That will only make me

06:31.190 --> 06:32.680
hate you more.

06:33.800 --> 06:34.870
Do you understand?

06:39.770 --> 06:43.100
♪ Setting sun, help me
weather through the big snow ♪

06:44.220 --> 06:47.690
♪ I'll wait till the next chapter
to get sorrowful ♪

06:48.570 --> 06:55.130
♪ Every word resonates with me
like dancing notes on the paper ♪

07:11.210 --> 07:14.680
♪ Wind, be with me
in the quest for an ideal ♪

07:15.740 --> 07:18.750
♪ Brush and ink,
stand with me on the cliff ♪

07:20.030 --> 07:26.680
♪ My heart measures
the waves I've cleaved ♪

07:29.030 --> 07:32.360
♪ Setting sun, help me
weather through the big snow ♪

07:33.500 --> 07:38.060
♪ I'll wait till the next chapter
to get sorrowful ♪

07:34.810 --> 07:35.830
Did you find them?

07:36.190 --> 07:36.920
General,

07:36.920 --> 07:39.180
we searched this place, but found no one.

07:39.600 --> 07:40.920
Search the lower floors with me.

07:40.210 --> 07:48.350
♪ Every word resonates with me
like dancing notes on the paper ♪

07:40.920 --> 07:41.720
-Yes!
-Yes!

07:57.610 --> 07:58.550
Miss Song?

08:00.210 --> 08:01.270
Where is Li Shiliu?

08:02.070 --> 08:03.040
I have nothing

08:03.390 --> 08:04.240
to do with him.

08:05.070 --> 08:05.870
Miss Song.

08:06.750 --> 08:08.080
What do you mean by this?

08:08.190 --> 08:09.720
Can the capital prefecture's office arrest

08:09.720 --> 08:12.480
innocent civilians when it
carries out its duties?

08:12.480 --> 08:14.360
You'll have to excuse me, Miss Song.

08:14.360 --> 08:16.160
This matter is about a major criminal.

08:16.160 --> 08:17.000
You should

08:17.390 --> 08:19.250
explain to General Chu in person.

09:10.720 --> 09:11.510
Fugui.

09:13.320 --> 09:15.450
Song Yimeng was taken away by Rong Hua.

09:16.120 --> 09:18.150
I need you to go to
Chu Guihong's residence

09:18.150 --> 09:19.950
and keep an eye on the situation there.

09:19.950 --> 09:21.810
Report to me if anything happens.

09:23.670 --> 09:24.870
Did you not hear...

09:34.550 --> 09:37.480
Your Highness, when do you
plan to tell me the truth?

09:42.790 --> 09:43.710
Uncle,

09:43.870 --> 09:45.870
are you here to denounce me?

09:46.720 --> 09:48.270
You're a counsellor of mine.

09:48.270 --> 09:49.270
I don't owe you any

09:50.030 --> 09:51.490
explanation on anything.

09:56.750 --> 09:57.910
You sheltered

09:57.910 --> 10:01.080
Shangguan Baihe for three years.

10:01.600 --> 10:02.480
Don't you owe me

10:03.390 --> 10:05.480
an explanation on this matter?

10:07.150 --> 10:09.750
When you embezzled
disaster relief funds years ago,

10:09.750 --> 10:12.240
I already informed you of its severity.

10:12.790 --> 10:14.550
For the sake of my mother,

10:14.550 --> 10:16.610
I cut you some slack for one last time.

10:22.330 --> 10:24.890
Even the most ignorant peasants

10:26.400 --> 10:29.510
know to protect their families.

10:30.900 --> 10:33.650
Your Highness, are you going
to thrust your own uncle

10:33.650 --> 10:34.690
into adversity?

10:34.710 --> 10:36.040
Your Highness, are you

10:37.360 --> 10:39.030
really a heartless man?

10:43.670 --> 10:45.240
Heartless?

10:47.330 --> 10:49.080
You call me "heartless"?

10:49.750 --> 10:52.550
I've always turned a blind eye
to all the evil deeds

10:52.630 --> 10:55.030
you've done over these years.

10:56.150 --> 10:57.870
Our kinship is the only reason

10:58.600 --> 11:00.670
that I haven't disclosed
your illegal acts.

11:00.670 --> 11:03.270
You should've been
executed a thousand times!

11:05.570 --> 11:07.290
Now that we're being honest,

11:09.360 --> 11:10.440
you might as well

11:10.960 --> 11:12.620
answer my question candidly.

11:14.550 --> 11:16.350
When Pingrong Battle happened,

11:18.910 --> 11:20.770
did you do anything out of bounds?

11:32.590 --> 11:34.170
Absolutely not.

11:42.540 --> 11:43.280
Okay.

11:46.330 --> 11:47.850
I'll believe you then.

11:50.010 --> 11:51.550
However, if one day

11:51.910 --> 11:55.200
I find out you've committed treason,

11:55.750 --> 11:57.410
I won't let you get away with it

11:58.480 --> 12:00.550
even though you're my uncle.

12:04.140 --> 12:05.890
I get it now.

12:07.320 --> 12:08.670
Your Highness thinks I'm old

12:08.670 --> 12:09.890
and useless.

12:10.000 --> 12:11.870
You can't wait to get rid of me.

12:12.630 --> 12:14.360
I don't want to talk about that.

12:14.550 --> 12:17.320
Chu Guihong is targeting
the Waning River Crescent now.

12:17.320 --> 12:19.650
He'll discover the truth sooner or later.

12:20.080 --> 12:21.910
You have to kill Shangguan Baihe,

12:21.910 --> 12:23.240
or your life,

12:23.240 --> 12:23.960
my life,

12:24.080 --> 12:25.140
your mother's life

12:25.550 --> 12:28.210
and all the lives of
the Gao family will be taken!

12:29.080 --> 12:30.910
The one dragging the Gao family down

12:30.910 --> 12:31.790
is not me,

12:33.550 --> 12:34.480
but you.

12:42.760 --> 12:50.600
[A long journey starts from the vicinity]

12:50.690 --> 12:53.590
[Qianyu Mansion]

12:58.150 --> 12:58.960
General.

13:03.000 --> 13:03.840
Yimeng,

13:04.840 --> 13:07.120
Li Shiliu is a key offender
of Shangguan He's case.

13:07.120 --> 13:08.440
Why did you go meet him?

13:09.070 --> 13:10.600
What did you two talk about?

13:12.480 --> 13:13.270
Chu Guihong,

13:14.200 --> 13:15.860
Shangguan He might be guilty,

13:16.390 --> 13:18.720
but the other Nightwalkers are innocent.

13:20.720 --> 13:22.120
Don't try to defend them.

13:22.750 --> 13:24.080
They're all on Nan Heng's side.

13:24.080 --> 13:25.540
None of them are innocent.

13:26.510 --> 13:27.640
What are you saying?

13:28.840 --> 13:30.570
When have you become like this?

13:33.740 --> 13:35.140
You made an oath

13:35.510 --> 13:37.910
before your aunt's
memorial tablet in childhood.

13:37.910 --> 13:39.000
Have you forgotten it?

13:39.000 --> 13:40.460
I have never forgotten it.

13:42.080 --> 13:44.350
I made a vow to prevent innocent people

13:44.790 --> 13:46.200
from being wrongfully killed.

13:46.200 --> 13:48.260
It's a principle I've always upheld.

13:49.080 --> 13:50.410
Everything I've done is

13:50.480 --> 13:51.510
in accordance with the law,

13:51.510 --> 13:52.640
fair and square.

13:52.790 --> 13:54.230
But by shutting down
the Waning River Crescent

13:54.230 --> 13:55.840
and going after the Nightwalkers,

13:55.840 --> 13:57.900
you're embroiling innocent people.

13:59.630 --> 14:01.220
The Nightwalkers once saved my life

14:01.220 --> 14:02.440
and lent a helping hand

14:02.440 --> 14:03.780
to you and Qianyu Army.

14:03.870 --> 14:05.000
But now, you are

14:05.150 --> 14:07.270
driving them into a corner.

14:31.270 --> 14:32.730
You're just feeling sorry

14:33.800 --> 14:35.260
for Li Shiliu, aren't you?

14:37.270 --> 14:38.080
Yimeng,

14:38.550 --> 14:40.010
I'm not suffocating them.

14:40.020 --> 14:41.490
You are suffocating me!

14:44.120 --> 14:45.320
I'm suffocating you?

14:46.390 --> 14:47.390
How come?

14:47.750 --> 14:50.280
You're turning me into
someone like Nan Heng!

14:51.090 --> 14:52.730
He's a villain in your eyes,

14:53.360 --> 14:54.910
so you're not surprised when he tricks

14:54.910 --> 14:56.000
and deceives you.

14:57.070 --> 14:58.050
By contrast,

14:59.000 --> 15:00.200
you consider me as

15:00.200 --> 15:01.800
a good person from Qianyu Army.

15:01.800 --> 15:04.670
You question me when I
take slightly harsh measures.

15:04.670 --> 15:05.640
Why?

15:06.600 --> 15:07.360
Why does a good person

15:07.360 --> 15:08.960
have to lose to a bad person?

15:08.960 --> 15:10.360
Why can't a good person do something

15:10.360 --> 15:11.270
as he watches the girl he likes

15:11.270 --> 15:12.800
being drawn to a bad person?

15:13.400 --> 15:16.130
Just in order to prove himself
to be a good person?

15:17.840 --> 15:18.940
Chu Guihong,

15:19.750 --> 15:20.820
being a good person

15:21.000 --> 15:23.260
isn't about proving anything to others,

15:24.080 --> 15:26.210
but about keeping a clear conscience.

15:27.910 --> 15:30.510
Your father spent
20-odd years nurturing you.

15:30.720 --> 15:32.600
If he saw what you're doing now...

15:32.600 --> 15:35.200
If I hadn't chosen to be
a good person years ago,

15:35.410 --> 15:37.540
perhaps my father wouldn't have died.

15:38.620 --> 15:40.000
If being a good person means

15:40.000 --> 15:41.150
not to fight back

15:41.150 --> 15:42.750
when his next of kin dies,

15:42.750 --> 15:45.880
or to lose the love of his life
to someone else again and again,

15:45.880 --> 15:46.880
then I'd rather be

15:48.940 --> 15:50.740
a more brutal and despicable man

15:51.750 --> 15:52.550
than Nan Heng.

16:10.390 --> 16:14.790
Long live Your Majesty!

16:13.210 --> 16:18.280
[Calm, Respectful, and Sincere]

16:15.000 --> 16:16.170
All rise.

16:17.150 --> 16:18.600
Thank Your Majesty.

16:24.750 --> 16:25.750
Your Majesty,

16:26.000 --> 16:27.880
I have a report to make.

16:29.150 --> 16:31.010
The capital prefecture's office

16:31.150 --> 16:33.210
is said to be making big moves lately.

16:34.150 --> 16:34.960
Speak up.

16:36.320 --> 16:37.120
Recently,

16:37.400 --> 16:39.320
I've caught a man
from the martial arts world,

16:39.320 --> 16:40.720
named Shangguan Baihe.

16:41.230 --> 16:42.440
Investigation results

16:42.440 --> 16:43.670
prove him to be
the absconding culprit

16:43.670 --> 16:45.740
of the theft case in Jiangnan
Province three years ago.

16:45.740 --> 16:47.360
Now, he has adopted a new identity

16:47.360 --> 16:50.000
as the second master of the Nightwalkers,
an organization in the martial arts world.

16:50.000 --> 16:52.200
The theft case in Jiangnan Province...

16:53.320 --> 16:56.540
It was handled by Heng, wasn't it?

16:57.270 --> 16:58.570
I remember

16:58.870 --> 17:01.480
all the offenders were
executed at that time.

17:03.670 --> 17:05.069
Your Majesty is correct.

17:05.829 --> 17:06.680
I suspect

17:06.960 --> 17:08.680
that the Seventh Prince proceeded with

17:08.680 --> 17:09.740
the case unjustly,

17:09.960 --> 17:12.359
and that he is now in collusion
with the Nightwalkers.

17:12.359 --> 17:13.790
I humbly request Your Majesty's

17:13.790 --> 17:15.550
authorization for me to lead Qianyu Army

17:15.550 --> 17:16.720
to search and seize his  residence

17:16.720 --> 17:18.000
for an investigation.

17:18.640 --> 17:20.040
In view of your concerns,

17:20.200 --> 17:20.750
I hereby...

17:20.750 --> 17:22.280
Think twice, Your Majesty.

17:23.400 --> 17:25.599
General Chu has exhibited no evidence.

17:25.720 --> 17:27.400
If Your Majesty is to make a ruling,

17:27.400 --> 17:30.300
please at least hear what
the Seventh Prince has to say.

17:30.300 --> 17:31.820
What can Heng say?

17:31.960 --> 17:33.200
When Guihong completes the investigation,

17:33.200 --> 17:34.400
he will present all the evidence

17:34.400 --> 17:35.920
before your eyes, Chancellor Gao.

17:35.920 --> 17:37.520
How can a prince's residence

17:38.160 --> 17:40.660
be searched and seized

17:41.200 --> 17:42.960
based on a false allegation?

17:45.000 --> 17:45.920
Minister Song,

17:46.620 --> 17:48.370
as head of the six ministries,

17:48.770 --> 17:49.580
would you care

17:50.070 --> 17:51.400
to share your insights?

17:59.000 --> 17:59.830
Mr. Song?

18:00.000 --> 18:00.830
Mr. Song!

18:01.770 --> 18:02.750
He's asking you.

18:03.650 --> 18:04.660
About what?

18:05.070 --> 18:06.000
Did you doze off?

18:06.200 --> 18:07.640
About Heng.

18:09.140 --> 18:10.270
The Seventh Prince?

18:12.440 --> 18:15.990
A family member of mine has
connections with His Highness.

18:16.190 --> 18:17.880
So, it's appropriate for me to

18:17.880 --> 18:18.940
comment on matters

18:19.270 --> 18:20.730
concerning His Highness.

18:26.110 --> 18:28.000
It is me that General Chu
finds suspicious.

18:28.000 --> 18:30.000
I'd like to prove my innocence on my own.

18:30.000 --> 18:31.730
Others shouldn't be involved.

18:32.720 --> 18:34.000
What a coincidence.

18:34.670 --> 18:36.530
I also have a report to make today.

18:39.120 --> 18:40.330
Your Majesty,

18:40.920 --> 18:42.080
the one colluding

18:42.160 --> 18:44.290
with those from the martial arts world

18:44.310 --> 18:46.710
and stirring up trouble non-stop recently

18:47.160 --> 18:48.750
is not me, but the general of Qianyu Army

18:48.750 --> 18:51.400
and the capital prefect
who is falsely accusing me,

18:51.400 --> 18:52.660
Chu Guihong.

18:52.890 --> 18:54.350
Nonsense!

18:54.710 --> 18:56.350
This is slander!

18:56.830 --> 18:57.850
Heng,

18:58.880 --> 19:00.880
anyone who falsely
charges against an official

19:00.880 --> 19:03.610
will be punished for
inciting factional fights.

19:04.040 --> 19:05.590
Your Majesty is right.

19:06.510 --> 19:07.560
But the fact is,

19:07.830 --> 19:09.530
despite the heavy protection

19:09.610 --> 19:11.480
provided by General Chu's Qianyu Army,

19:11.480 --> 19:12.940
I was nearly assassinated

19:13.110 --> 19:15.200
at the Lantern Festival.

19:15.800 --> 19:17.010
Now that I think of it,

19:17.590 --> 19:18.990
I still feel frightened.

19:19.270 --> 19:20.620
Today, General Chu

19:20.730 --> 19:22.070
is confusing the officials

19:22.070 --> 19:24.130
and fabricating charges against me.

19:24.350 --> 19:25.440
So, I feel the need

19:25.960 --> 19:27.270
to make a statement.

19:27.960 --> 19:29.400
Go ahead.

19:32.750 --> 19:35.080
That assassination case has been closed.

19:35.610 --> 19:39.750
Some people from the martial arts world
attacked me in the disguise of Nightwalkers.

19:39.750 --> 19:41.280
But I'm puzzled

19:41.400 --> 19:42.200
by two things.

19:43.030 --> 19:43.940
First,

19:44.110 --> 19:46.290
the security arrangements for the festival

19:46.290 --> 19:47.680
were made by Qianyu Army.

19:47.680 --> 19:49.780
Yet an injured man
from the martial arts world

19:49.780 --> 19:53.060
managed to escape
in the presence of General Chu

19:53.090 --> 19:54.820
and dozens of Qianyu soldiers.

19:55.110 --> 19:56.640
Something must've gone wrong.

19:56.640 --> 19:57.900
I contend that this man

19:57.940 --> 20:00.140
was assisted by someone in Qianyu Army.

20:00.160 --> 20:01.110
Second,

20:01.480 --> 20:02.990
the assassin showed up

20:03.110 --> 20:04.770
and retreated without cause.

20:04.880 --> 20:06.940
Besides, he was instructed by no one.

20:06.960 --> 20:10.070
At that time, I already had many doubts.

20:10.240 --> 20:12.240
But Your Majesty didn't want
to pursue the matter further,

20:12.240 --> 20:15.000
so, to maintain political stability,

20:15.000 --> 20:16.350
I had to set it aside.

20:16.720 --> 20:17.680
A few days ago,

20:17.700 --> 20:20.070
General Chu made me go to
the capital prefecture's prison

20:20.070 --> 20:22.460
for Shangguan Baihe's case.

20:22.680 --> 20:23.680
Coincidentally,

20:23.880 --> 20:25.890
some thugs broke in,
trying to rescue the prisoner.

20:25.890 --> 20:27.420
I was wounded in the course.

20:28.510 --> 20:29.880
What bewilders me is

20:30.200 --> 20:31.200
that General Chu

20:31.200 --> 20:33.220
shifted all the blame to the Nightwalkers

20:33.220 --> 20:34.500
before catching

20:34.590 --> 20:36.970
the mastermind.

20:37.190 --> 20:38.440
Are you saying

20:39.220 --> 20:40.680
that neither the assassin

20:40.880 --> 20:42.480
nor the prisoner's rescuers

20:42.720 --> 20:45.050
are members of the Waning River Crescent?

20:46.830 --> 20:48.310
Yes. It is wise of Your Majesty.

20:48.310 --> 20:49.270
I suspect

20:49.290 --> 20:51.960
that General Chu hired people
from the martial arts world

20:51.960 --> 20:54.070
to assassinate me and rescue the prisoner.

20:54.070 --> 20:57.270
Then, he framed the Waning
River Crescent for the crimes.

20:57.290 --> 20:58.450
Your Highness,

20:58.880 --> 21:01.280
if a man can be convicted without proof,

21:01.680 --> 21:03.460
then what is the use of the law?

21:03.590 --> 21:05.350
Did you hear that, Heng?

21:05.590 --> 21:07.830
Convictions can't be made without proof.

21:07.830 --> 21:10.070
If you're just venturing a speculation...

21:10.070 --> 21:11.110
I have proof.

21:13.470 --> 21:14.130
Bring it in.

21:14.520 --> 21:16.670
[Calm, Respectful, and Sincere]

21:17.110 --> 21:18.550
Bring it in!

21:38.550 --> 21:40.550
Mr. Chu, do you recognize this mask?

21:55.400 --> 21:57.300
If Mr. Chu can't recall,

21:57.680 --> 21:59.350
I believe the Eighteen Prince

21:59.370 --> 22:01.350
must know the origins of this mask.

22:01.650 --> 22:02.190
I...

22:02.210 --> 22:03.160
Heng,

22:03.620 --> 22:05.280
don't keep me in suspense.

22:05.680 --> 22:07.070
Just tell the truth.

22:08.000 --> 22:09.070
Your Majesty,

22:09.440 --> 22:10.750
several days before I was attacked

22:10.750 --> 22:12.150
at the Lantern Festival,

22:13.030 --> 22:15.510
General Chu caused a disturbance

22:15.610 --> 22:18.000
in the Waning River Crescent
with this mask on,

22:18.000 --> 22:19.980
and antagonized the Nightwalkers.

22:19.980 --> 22:22.180
There were many witnesses at the scene,

22:23.110 --> 22:25.040
including the Eighteenth Prince.

22:31.400 --> 22:33.660
What else do you have to say, General Chu?

22:37.240 --> 22:38.220
Chu Guihong,

22:39.400 --> 22:40.830
how do you explain this?

22:42.500 --> 22:43.830
I impersonated Li Shiliu

22:43.830 --> 22:45.510
only to figure out
if the Seventh Prince was

22:45.510 --> 22:47.350
in collusion with the Nightwalkers.

22:47.350 --> 22:48.160
Collusion?

22:49.390 --> 22:51.550
General Chu, did you start taking me

22:51.790 --> 22:54.880
and the Nightwalkers as outlaws long ago?

22:55.790 --> 22:57.590
Anyone who falsely
charges against an official

22:57.590 --> 23:00.320
will be punished for
inciting factional fights.

23:02.750 --> 23:03.860
Your Majesty,

23:04.330 --> 23:05.380
it is my belief

23:05.410 --> 23:07.120
that the assassination and
the attempted prison break

23:07.120 --> 23:09.300
were done by Chu Guihong
out of spite and revenge,

23:09.300 --> 23:10.740
for the purposes of harming me

23:10.740 --> 23:12.780
and incriminating the Nightwalkers.

23:12.780 --> 23:14.830
As the capital prefect, Chu
Guihong abused his power

23:14.830 --> 23:15.940
for personal vendettas

23:15.940 --> 23:17.070
and knowingly broke the law.

23:17.070 --> 23:18.530
He should be executed.

23:18.740 --> 23:19.770
Nan Heng,

23:19.800 --> 23:21.590
you're committing the crime
of deceiving the sovereign

23:21.590 --> 23:22.660
by distorting the truth!

23:22.660 --> 23:23.710
Stop bickering!

23:24.640 --> 23:27.750
A prince and the capital prefect
are hurling accusations at each other.

23:27.750 --> 23:29.010
What a disgrace!

23:30.000 --> 23:32.000
A nobody from the martial arts world

23:32.110 --> 23:34.460
has caused such chaos in the court.

23:34.590 --> 23:35.640
In my opinion,

23:36.000 --> 23:37.310
Shangguan Baihe

23:37.340 --> 23:38.670
must be killed.

23:39.030 --> 23:39.920
Why not

23:39.920 --> 23:41.920
behead him in public

23:41.920 --> 23:43.200
tomorrow?

23:43.200 --> 23:44.000
Your Majesty,

23:44.310 --> 23:45.790
the truth of the case
is yet to be revealed.

23:45.790 --> 23:47.720
Please don't make a rash decision.

23:48.270 --> 23:49.850
Your Highness is merciful.

23:50.030 --> 23:51.170
I understand that.

23:51.480 --> 23:53.480
But this case will never be resolved

23:53.590 --> 23:55.760
until Shangguan Baihe is dead.

23:58.200 --> 23:59.890
To prove your innocence,

24:00.400 --> 24:02.930
Your Highness should
oversee the execution.

24:03.210 --> 24:06.140
If the Seventh Prince
truly executes that criminal,

24:06.240 --> 24:09.270
General Chu, you must pay for
falsely accusing His Highness,

24:09.270 --> 24:10.480
confess that you colluded

24:10.480 --> 24:13.610
with outlaws to plan an
assassination against a prince,

24:13.960 --> 24:16.760
resign from your position
as the capital prefect,

24:16.880 --> 24:18.610
and be demoted to be a commoner.

24:19.000 --> 24:20.590
Don't try to intimidate anyone!

24:20.590 --> 24:22.480
What if Heng sides with Shangguan Baihe

24:22.480 --> 24:23.750
and can't bring himself

24:23.750 --> 24:25.200
to kill that criminal?

24:25.200 --> 24:25.830
If so,

24:26.440 --> 24:28.350
I'll take my own life in the court

24:28.590 --> 24:30.970
to atone for falsely accusing General Chu

24:31.270 --> 24:32.070
today!

24:43.850 --> 24:45.780
You crossed the line today, Uncle.

24:49.440 --> 24:50.300
Your Highness,

24:51.350 --> 24:53.160
you almost gave yourself away

24:53.720 --> 24:55.420
in the court just now.

24:55.920 --> 24:57.000
I thought that move was

24:57.000 --> 24:59.240
the last chance to deter Chu Guihong.

24:59.240 --> 25:01.000
Hesitation could only

25:01.000 --> 25:02.570
lead to a giant failure.

25:03.440 --> 25:04.590
What stands between

25:05.240 --> 25:06.720
you and success is mercy.

25:10.030 --> 25:10.880
Nan Heng,

25:12.000 --> 25:13.980
I told Shangguan He yesterday

25:14.000 --> 25:14.830
that trusting you

25:14.830 --> 25:16.200
would cost him his life.

25:16.680 --> 25:18.840
What you did today proves me right.

25:20.360 --> 25:21.230
Thank you.

25:21.940 --> 25:23.060
Now,

25:23.470 --> 25:25.070
I'm free of moral restraints

25:25.420 --> 25:27.050
when I do anything.

25:28.350 --> 25:30.790
Guihong, why even bother talking to him?

25:30.910 --> 25:32.360
Breathing the same air

25:32.390 --> 25:34.110
as a vile person like him

25:34.110 --> 25:35.530
really disgusts me!

25:35.920 --> 25:36.750
Let's go.

25:52.440 --> 25:53.240
My Lady!

25:53.760 --> 25:55.640
Please eat something.

25:55.640 --> 25:56.310
My Lady,

25:56.310 --> 25:57.550
you've locked yourself inside

25:57.550 --> 25:58.350
for a day and night.

25:58.350 --> 25:59.640
What happened to you?

25:59.640 --> 26:01.070
You can tell us about it!

26:01.070 --> 26:01.880
My Lady!

26:02.240 --> 26:03.000
My Lady!

26:03.510 --> 26:04.110
My Lady!

26:07.310 --> 26:08.000
Yimeng!

26:07.490 --> 26:10.930
[Laiyi House]

26:08.000 --> 26:08.720
My Lady!

26:08.750 --> 26:09.790
Yimeng!

26:09.920 --> 26:11.230
An imperial edict was made today.

26:11.230 --> 26:12.920
Shangguan He will be executed tomorrow.

26:12.920 --> 26:14.320
I beg you to save his life!

26:34.880 --> 26:35.740
Your Highness,

26:36.220 --> 26:37.830
Chancellor Gao has destroyed

26:37.830 --> 26:39.270
all the clothes of Li Shiliu

26:39.270 --> 26:40.160
in the mansion.

26:40.870 --> 26:42.130
As for Shangguan He...

26:42.310 --> 26:43.110
Now,

26:43.510 --> 26:44.720
the capital prefecture's prison

26:44.720 --> 26:46.390
is guarded by Qianyu Army

26:46.510 --> 26:47.310
and

26:47.350 --> 26:48.920
some elite calvary forces
borrowed by Chancellor Gao

26:48.920 --> 26:50.160
from the Emperor.

26:53.960 --> 26:55.310
My uncle truly

26:55.310 --> 26:56.830
is a scheming man.

26:57.950 --> 26:59.240
He's trying to cut

26:59.260 --> 27:01.350
all my ties with the Nightwalkers,

27:02.510 --> 27:03.310
so he will be

27:03.770 --> 27:05.720
the only one I can rely on.

27:07.400 --> 27:08.260
Your Highness,

27:08.320 --> 27:09.330
will you really

27:09.590 --> 27:11.190
kill Shangguan He tomorrow?

27:14.440 --> 27:15.640
The Emperor is forcing

27:15.640 --> 27:17.170
me to depart for my fiefdom.

27:17.750 --> 27:20.350
Chu Guihong is forcing me to plead guilty.

27:20.830 --> 27:21.880
Even my uncle

27:22.640 --> 27:24.240
is forcing me to kill.

27:25.400 --> 27:26.790
Everyone is trying

27:26.790 --> 27:28.550
to manipulate me.

27:29.880 --> 27:31.880
But even if I'm in a dead end,

27:33.010 --> 27:35.430
I'll fight my way through.

27:40.190 --> 27:43.580
[Laiyi House]

27:44.270 --> 27:45.750
There is only one way

27:45.920 --> 27:47.120
to save Shangguan He.

27:47.270 --> 27:48.340
What is it?

27:48.440 --> 27:49.880
To clear his name by finding out

27:49.880 --> 27:52.080
the truth of the case he was involved in.

27:52.790 --> 27:53.640
I'm afraid we can't

27:53.640 --> 27:55.040
make it in just one night.

27:55.640 --> 27:56.440
Yiting,

27:56.440 --> 27:57.620
don't fret.

27:57.640 --> 27:59.030
The situation is not desperate yet.

27:59.030 --> 28:00.490
We can turn things around.

28:01.350 --> 28:03.010
But we don't have helpers now.

28:03.010 --> 28:05.210
We can't turn to Nan Heng or Chu Guihong.

28:05.240 --> 28:07.100
Nor can we let Dad know about this.

28:07.140 --> 28:08.120
We can turn to

28:09.240 --> 28:10.560
the Nightwalkers

28:10.750 --> 28:12.400
and try postponing the execution.

28:12.400 --> 28:13.030
Shanhu!

28:13.440 --> 28:14.070
Shanhu!

28:15.510 --> 28:15.920
Shanhu!

28:15.920 --> 28:16.400
Spill it.

28:16.400 --> 28:17.540
What did you find?

28:17.830 --> 28:20.160
Chancellor Gao has sent 200
more elite calvary troopers

28:20.160 --> 28:21.480
to guard the capital prefecture's prison.

28:21.480 --> 28:22.160
200?

28:22.160 --> 28:23.200
That'll make tonight's

28:23.200 --> 28:24.480
rescue mission even harder.

28:24.480 --> 28:25.400
How can we save him?

28:25.400 --> 28:26.420
Yeah.

28:26.510 --> 28:28.240
The prison is heavily guarded.

28:30.640 --> 28:32.100
So what if it's difficult?

28:32.260 --> 28:34.860
Have we Nightwalkers
been afraid of anything?

28:35.350 --> 28:36.110
At worst,

28:36.130 --> 28:38.000
we'll die before Second Master does.

28:38.000 --> 28:39.840
We can be brothers again in hell.

28:39.960 --> 28:41.110
If you're scared,

28:41.480 --> 28:42.680
then don't follow me!

28:50.440 --> 28:51.110
Yunlong,

28:51.200 --> 28:52.530
what do you mean by this?

28:52.590 --> 28:53.850
There are many guards.

28:54.030 --> 28:55.670
You'll all die if you go.

28:55.880 --> 28:56.720
Let me do it.

28:57.240 --> 28:58.000
If I survive,

28:58.400 --> 28:59.800
meet me outside the city.

29:00.310 --> 29:01.110
If I die,

29:02.240 --> 29:03.270
leave me there.

29:04.110 --> 29:04.870
No!

29:26.730 --> 29:28.240
The masters' women are here.

29:28.240 --> 29:29.030
Who?

29:29.400 --> 29:30.400
The Song sisters.

29:32.360 --> 29:33.160
Open the door.

29:42.930 --> 29:44.620
Nan Heng took off his mask

29:45.000 --> 29:46.270
in front of you guys?

29:47.830 --> 29:48.640
He threatened us,

29:48.640 --> 29:50.070
saying that we had to leave the capital,

29:50.070 --> 29:50.830
or

29:51.240 --> 29:52.170
he would kill us.

29:59.550 --> 30:01.280
He addressed those harsh words

30:01.490 --> 30:03.890
only to persuade you
not to risk your lives.

30:05.670 --> 30:08.330
What a model of probity
at this critical moment.

30:08.790 --> 30:10.030
That is what Li Shiliu

30:10.030 --> 30:11.590
would normally say.

30:11.590 --> 30:12.960
But he is Nan Heng,

30:14.440 --> 30:16.230
Great Jing's brutal God of Death.

30:16.230 --> 30:18.430
What are the odds of him being our chief?

30:22.110 --> 30:24.110
Li Shiliu and the Seventh Prince...

30:25.550 --> 30:27.960
Which identity represents Nan Heng best?

30:30.060 --> 30:30.870
Mrs. Li,

30:31.880 --> 30:33.000
don't be upset.

30:33.000 --> 30:33.640
Nan...

30:35.310 --> 30:36.680
Chief really loves you.

30:36.680 --> 30:37.510
Though the way he treats us...

30:37.510 --> 30:38.110
Cut it out.

30:38.550 --> 30:40.440
I don't want to talk about that now.

30:40.440 --> 30:41.400
Li Shiliu

30:42.110 --> 30:44.070
on longer exists in this world.

30:44.510 --> 30:45.770
Chief is still with us.

30:46.240 --> 30:47.170
We need to rescue

30:47.590 --> 30:48.850
Second Master as well.

30:49.970 --> 30:52.370
You're planning to rescue him from prison?

30:54.110 --> 30:54.960
-Don't!
-Don't!

30:54.960 --> 30:56.640
But Second Master will
be executed tomorrow.

30:56.640 --> 30:57.200
What else

30:57.200 --> 30:58.510
option do we have?

30:58.590 --> 30:59.920
There is one, of course.

31:00.240 --> 31:01.480
We'll stall the execution

31:01.480 --> 31:02.710
and clear his name.

31:11.550 --> 31:12.480
Mrs. Shangguan,

31:13.070 --> 31:15.400
can we really save
Second Master this way?

31:15.590 --> 31:16.590
Don't call me that,

31:16.590 --> 31:18.050
or I'll make you regret it.

31:21.310 --> 31:22.880
Shangguan He's conviction

31:23.030 --> 31:23.920
comes from

31:24.160 --> 31:26.160
stealing disaster relief funds.

31:27.030 --> 31:28.910
If this charge drops,

31:29.240 --> 31:30.720
he won't be executed.

31:34.160 --> 31:35.770
Think it through, Yimeng.

31:36.240 --> 31:38.570
By revealing the truth of this theft case,

31:38.590 --> 31:39.480
you'll make

31:40.010 --> 31:41.350
an enemy of Nan Heng.

31:44.920 --> 31:46.780
Even Li Shiliu is a fake identity.

31:46.830 --> 31:48.830
You think I'd care about
Nan Heng's opinion?

31:48.830 --> 31:50.300
I'm helping Shangguan He

31:50.510 --> 31:51.400
for friends

31:51.830 --> 31:52.840
and everyone.

31:53.000 --> 31:54.860
It has nothing to do with Nan Heng.

31:55.520 --> 31:56.880
You know you're lying.

32:00.000 --> 32:00.990
Mrs. Li,

32:01.070 --> 32:03.350
you're wrong about Chief.

32:03.440 --> 32:04.530
Don't call me that.

32:04.660 --> 32:06.920
What's between us is more
complicated than you think.

32:06.920 --> 32:08.180
You don't understand.

32:08.590 --> 32:09.410
I do.

32:09.550 --> 32:10.590
How do I not?

32:10.990 --> 32:12.200
You like Li Shiliu,

32:12.200 --> 32:13.730
and Li Shiliu likes you too.

32:13.830 --> 32:15.750
You're mad because Chief lied to you.

32:15.750 --> 32:16.160
But

32:16.160 --> 32:17.760
that's just the way Chief is.

32:18.000 --> 32:19.110
He just can't bring himself

32:19.110 --> 32:20.240
to say nice things.

32:20.790 --> 32:21.750
Beneath that poker face of his,

32:21.750 --> 32:23.000
there is a warm heart.

32:23.440 --> 32:24.830
He is usually indifferent

32:24.830 --> 32:25.830
when he sees women.

32:25.830 --> 32:26.880
But whenever he sees you,

32:26.880 --> 32:28.210
he is especially happy.

32:28.980 --> 32:30.220
He always has a mask on.

32:30.220 --> 32:31.880
How do you know if he is happy or not?

32:31.880 --> 32:32.510
I...

32:33.200 --> 32:33.960
Mrs. Shangguan,

32:33.960 --> 32:34.590
whose side are you on?

32:34.590 --> 32:35.650
Don't call me that!

32:40.960 --> 32:43.000
Stop looking for trouble

32:43.530 --> 32:45.090
where none exists.

32:46.110 --> 32:47.480
It's not easy to find

32:47.590 --> 32:48.880
someone you love

32:49.070 --> 32:50.470
amidst so many men, is it?

32:51.590 --> 32:52.480
Yiting,

32:52.920 --> 32:55.000
if Shangguan He deceives you like this,

32:55.000 --> 32:56.680
will you believe he loves you?

32:58.070 --> 33:00.000
Has he not deceived me the same way?

33:01.960 --> 33:02.750
Well...

33:04.790 --> 33:05.720
It's different.

33:08.510 --> 33:09.430
Yes.

33:09.460 --> 33:10.410
It is different.

33:10.620 --> 33:12.480
My situation is worse than yours.

33:12.770 --> 33:14.300
He runs away when he sees me.

33:14.350 --> 33:16.280
Even when I catch up, he runs again.

33:16.470 --> 33:17.670
But does it matter?

33:21.070 --> 33:22.740
Nan Heng did lie to you.

33:22.890 --> 33:24.820
But you lied to him too, didn't you?

33:27.290 --> 33:28.900
Aren't you clear if Nan Heng

33:28.920 --> 33:30.570
is in love with you or not?

33:35.090 --> 33:36.330
I saw something.

33:36.880 --> 33:38.920
Chief secretly drew
portraits of you in his room.

33:38.920 --> 33:40.880
He stashed the files
about your information

33:40.880 --> 33:42.740
and read them several times a day.

33:43.070 --> 33:43.880
Oh right,

33:43.880 --> 33:45.000
do you remember

33:45.000 --> 33:45.950
those two fish?

33:46.400 --> 33:47.720
When you two argue,

33:47.720 --> 33:48.480
Chief would

33:48.480 --> 33:50.140
separate them with a stick.

33:50.170 --> 33:51.440
Blatant abuse, isn't it?

33:51.440 --> 33:52.520
That's abuse.

33:58.110 --> 33:59.340
I don't know

33:59.590 --> 34:00.950
what Nan Heng is like.

34:01.440 --> 34:02.550
But the Nightwalkers

34:02.550 --> 34:03.680
all trust Li Shiliu.

34:04.280 --> 34:05.760
If he says he likes you,

34:05.880 --> 34:07.170
then he must mean it.

34:07.440 --> 34:08.840
We respect you as Mrs. Li.

34:09.110 --> 34:10.030
You have

34:10.510 --> 34:11.480
that respect now

34:12.010 --> 34:13.080
and forever.

34:51.550 --> 34:53.300
How magnificent.

34:53.880 --> 34:56.080
So many people are bidding me farewell.

34:56.150 --> 34:57.280
It's worth dying.

35:01.750 --> 35:03.700
You look sad. Why?

35:04.150 --> 35:06.080
Are you friends with

35:06.230 --> 35:07.550
Shangguan Baihe?

35:11.230 --> 35:12.320
Do I look sad?

35:13.630 --> 35:15.360
I'm bursting with impatience.

35:15.360 --> 35:16.280
I'm ecstatic.

35:23.510 --> 35:25.010
People mourn the passing

35:25.510 --> 35:26.840
of those of their kind.

35:41.320 --> 35:42.180
Your Highness.

35:45.850 --> 35:48.330
All the eyes of Qianyu
Army are on you today.

35:49.480 --> 35:51.110
No slip is allowed.

35:55.770 --> 35:56.700
Your Highness,

35:58.880 --> 36:00.480
Shangguan Baihe must die,

36:01.000 --> 36:02.260
or I'll be the one to die

36:03.030 --> 36:04.830
tomorrow in the imperial court.

36:05.440 --> 36:06.820
Your Highness,

36:07.150 --> 36:08.760
sort out your priorities.

36:10.150 --> 36:11.530
You're an important official

36:11.530 --> 36:13.460
with immense power and influence.

36:13.480 --> 36:14.670
You must be kidding.

36:20.620 --> 36:24.920
[Yongde Gate]

36:27.270 --> 36:28.840
Shangguan Baihe, a leader of thugs,

36:28.840 --> 36:29.880
shall be executed for committing

36:29.880 --> 36:31.110
numerous atrocities.

36:31.110 --> 36:32.880
The Emperor has granted
a written approval,

36:32.880 --> 36:34.400
appointing the Seventh Prince

36:34.400 --> 36:36.000
to supervise the execution,

36:36.110 --> 36:38.110
which will be carried out in no time.

36:41.030 --> 36:41.940
Your Highness,

36:41.960 --> 36:43.360
please order to proceed.

36:45.730 --> 36:46.960
Verify his identity.

36:50.710 --> 36:51.910
Verify his identity?

36:52.560 --> 36:54.890
Why the unnecessary move, Your Highness?

36:55.370 --> 36:57.060
I'd hate to give you the satisfaction

36:57.060 --> 36:58.860
by executing the wrong criminal

36:59.140 --> 37:01.070
and being punished by the Emperor.

37:08.030 --> 37:08.670
What are you doing?

37:08.670 --> 37:10.530
Does my face look like clay to you?

37:10.630 --> 37:11.630
Now is the wrong time

37:11.630 --> 37:12.610
to joke around, isn't it?

37:12.610 --> 37:14.410
Can't you let me have a quick death?

37:14.410 --> 37:15.490
What's the point of all this?

37:15.490 --> 37:16.320
You want to die?

37:16.320 --> 37:17.520
It won't be that easy.

37:18.400 --> 37:19.330
What do you mean?

37:33.970 --> 37:34.670
Execute!

37:38.910 --> 37:40.220
[Approved]

38:00.580 --> 38:01.590
There's a secret passage.

38:01.590 --> 38:02.770
The exit is on the right.

38:02.770 --> 38:03.790
To the right side!

38:29.360 --> 38:30.510
I've resigned myself to being killed.

38:30.510 --> 38:31.840
Don't take risks for me.

38:34.630 --> 38:35.320
Your Highness,

38:35.320 --> 38:36.440
the criminal's identity has been

38:36.440 --> 38:37.920
verified and confirmed.

38:44.040 --> 38:44.930
Execute!

38:49.250 --> 38:50.470
[Approved]

39:01.440 --> 39:02.000
Wait!

39:02.020 --> 39:02.820
Wait!

39:02.850 --> 39:04.180
I have something to say.

39:13.440 --> 39:14.550
His Highness,

39:14.780 --> 39:17.180
I know I committed appalling crimes.

39:17.230 --> 39:18.690
All I want is a quick death.

39:18.920 --> 39:19.850
But before that,

39:21.160 --> 39:22.670
I'd like to have a drink to quench

39:22.670 --> 39:23.920
my sudden thirst for alcohol

39:23.920 --> 39:25.050
and to brace myself.

39:25.190 --> 39:27.320
I beg for Your Highness's permission.

39:27.680 --> 39:28.590
You're about to die.

39:28.590 --> 39:29.960
Just cut the crap!

39:30.320 --> 39:31.520
Calm, Your Highness.

39:32.430 --> 39:34.430
I'll atone for my wrongs with my life

39:34.800 --> 39:36.410
after my one last drink.

39:40.490 --> 39:42.490
What if my real identity is exposed?

39:45.920 --> 39:48.250
Atone for your wrongs with your life then.

39:56.230 --> 39:57.520
It's already noon.

39:57.620 --> 39:59.030
The criminal must be executed now.

39:59.030 --> 40:00.430
I am the supervisor here.

40:01.030 --> 40:02.040
Chancellor Gao,

40:02.630 --> 40:04.760
aren't you overstepping your bounds?

40:05.070 --> 40:06.590
The token has been thrown out.

40:06.590 --> 40:08.590
Why are you delaying the execution?

40:11.480 --> 40:12.680
Your Highness,

40:12.800 --> 40:14.530
are you just stalling for time?

40:35.760 --> 40:36.980
If there's a change of situation,

40:36.980 --> 40:38.110
ignite the explosives

40:38.110 --> 40:39.070
create chaos,

40:39.070 --> 40:41.070
and seek a chance to save the target.

40:47.630 --> 40:49.190
Phantom dragon lurks in the black market.

40:49.190 --> 40:51.520
Radiant lanterns
illuminate the Nightwalkers.

40:51.520 --> 40:53.400
[Yongde Gate]

40:51.880 --> 40:53.330
I'm a Nightwalker.

40:53.440 --> 40:54.840
Nobody can hurt this man!

40:55.060 --> 40:55.710
It's Shanhu.

40:55.710 --> 40:56.610
What are you waiting for?

40:56.610 --> 40:58.280
Catch the intruder now!

40:57.160 --> 40:59.930
♪ Phantom dragon
lurks in the black market ♪

40:59.340 --> 41:00.630
Here come the Nightwalkers.

41:00.630 --> 41:02.290
Don't you dare hurt Shangguan Baihe!

41:01.800 --> 41:04.840
♪ Radiant lanterns
illuminate the Nightwalkers ♪

41:03.320 --> 41:04.110
Yunlong?

41:06.640 --> 41:08.620
♪ In the dark of night,
pure dreams run deep and wide ♪

41:06.960 --> 41:07.800
Nan Heng,

41:08.400 --> 41:10.140
now I understand why
you were stalling for time.

41:09.220 --> 41:11.230
♪ Who dares to join the game?
This isn't child's play ♪

41:10.370 --> 41:12.120
You were waiting for these outlaws

41:11.780 --> 41:14.210
♪ Footsteps that shake the sky,
fear refuses to fade ♪

41:12.150 --> 41:13.480
to rescue the criminal.

41:13.770 --> 41:15.140
Now, can you still deny being

41:14.790 --> 41:17.180
♪ Every punch lands
hard on this wild melody ♪

41:15.320 --> 41:16.890
connected to the Nightwalkers?

41:16.890 --> 41:18.870
[Yongde Gate]

41:17.540 --> 41:18.510
General Chu,

41:19.590 --> 41:21.030
don't you want to wipe out

41:21.030 --> 41:22.630
the entire Waning River Crescent?

41:22.630 --> 41:24.030
I suggest you carefully consider

41:24.030 --> 41:25.750
if you have what it takes.

41:27.150 --> 41:28.920
Phantom dragon lurks in the black market,

41:27.760 --> 41:29.310
♪ I ride on the wind
of the waning river crescent ♪

41:29.030 --> 41:30.830
Radiant lanterns
illuminate the Nightwalkers

41:30.200 --> 41:32.030
♪ Hate the injustice in the world ♪

41:32.640 --> 41:35.090
♪ Loyalty and righteousness
weigh on both sides of the scale ♪

41:33.110 --> 41:34.710
We're Nightwalkers.

41:34.710 --> 41:36.480
Greetings, officers.

41:35.680 --> 41:37.740
♪ Wield the knife
to carve a rift in the hell ♪

41:39.520 --> 41:42.400
♪ Phantom dragon
lurks in the black market ♪

41:40.280 --> 41:42.280
The Nightwalker of Waning River Crescent,

41:42.280 --> 41:44.210
Greetings, officers.

41:45.080 --> 41:47.650
♪ Radiant lanterns
illuminate the Nightwalkers ♪
